# Real controlled documents used for local testing.
#
# These are company SOPs. Committing one would disclose it to everyone with
# access to the repository, permanently and outside Document Control - which
# is precisely what this application exists to prevent. Test documents stay
# on the machine that needs them.
*.pdf
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.doc
*.xls
!tests/fixtures/**
!analyzer/tests/fixtures/**

